[PrintTextModified Text:她们来到医务室，<br>便看见躺在床上的安安，还有梅露露。|#0101Adv30_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:雪、雪莉小姐，<br>你的脸色不是很好……|#0101Adv30_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露最先注意到脸色发白的雪莉，<br>一脸担心地走了过来。|#0101Adv30_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽说健康和充满活力是我屈指可数的优点啦，<br>但还是感觉好累啊。唔……不应该啊。|#0101Adv30_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请、请你休息一下！<br>我去给你泡缓解疲劳的香草茶哦……！|#0101Adv30_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR10,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:哇！谢谢你！|#0101Adv30_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露开始用壶烧水，<br>艾玛走到她身旁。|#0101Adv30_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露。|#0101Adv30_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:什、什么事～～……！|#0101Adv30_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露精神集中在泡茶上，<br>听到有人喊她，不禁吓到抖了一下。|#0101Adv30_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:哇，不好意思吓到你！|#0101Adv30_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:没、没事的没事的！<br>被吓到都是我的不好，对不起……！|#0101Adv30_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我、我要做深呼吸，<br>请你等我一下……嘶～呼～嘶～呼～……|#0101Adv30_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:等梅露露冷静下来后，<br>艾玛便开口问。|#0101Adv30_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:安安的情况怎么样了？|#0101Adv30_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:现在已经冷静下来了……她一定受到了很大的冲击，<br>毕竟回自己的房间时却看到了诺亚小姐她……|#0101Adv30_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露眼眶湿润，似乎马上就要哭出来似的。|#0101Adv30_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我还没来得及为诺亚小姐做任何事，她就……|#0101Adv30_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:谁都不会想到<br>会发生这种事……啊，对了！|#0101Adv30_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛不忍心看到梅露露垂头丧气的样子，<br>于是大声说道。|#0101Adv30_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那是什么香草？<br>你还会摘香草泡茶，真的好厉害。|#0101Adv30_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:是迷迭香。<br>这个很有益于恢复疲劳哦。|#0101Adv30_Meruru008| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来艾玛成功分散了她的注意力，<br>梅露露的脸上终于露出了些许笑容。|#0101Adv30_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请你们一定要喝一口看看哦。|#0101Adv30_Meruru009| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，谢谢你。|#0101Adv30_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ========================================
; [sfx 31：お茶を淹れる音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_31 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一行人<br>从梅露露手里接过香草茶。|#0101Adv30_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（好清爽通透的香气……<br>　感觉整个人都变得舒服了一些）|#0101Adv30_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:经过短暂的休息，<br>艾玛望向安安所在的床上。|#0101Adv30_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（安安和诺亚是住在同一间房的……<br>　我想和她谈一谈）|#0101Adv30_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（有些担心<br>　能不能和她顺利对话……）|#0101Adv30_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛下定了决心，<br>来到安安的面前。|#0101Adv30_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:安安，你还好吗……？|#0101Adv30_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0101Adv30_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛站在床边，<br>看到安安眼神呆滞地望着天花板。|#0101Adv30_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那个，安安你和诺亚她<br>住在同一间房，对不对。|#0101Adv30_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然你和她相处的时间<br>应该不是很长……你有没有注意到什么特别的事？|#0101Adv30_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安大大地叹了一口气，<br>毫无干劲地取出了素描本。|#0101Adv30_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她在上面唰唰地写着什么东西，<br>然后举起来给艾玛看。|#0101Adv30_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms02_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『吾辈非常非常讨厌和她住一间房』|#0101Adv30_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:写在素描本上的文字<br>强烈地反映出了她的心声。|#0101Adv30_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:也、也是啦……|#0101Adv30_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（嗯——？）|#0101Adv30_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:素描本的一角留有折痕，<br>而折痕后稍稍露出的内容吸引住了艾玛的视线。|#0101Adv30_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:安安，我说，<br>你在那一页上面画的是——|#0101Adv30_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]


@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1-Option-All
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛伸手指着那一角，<br>安安变得有些心虚，把视线移到了别处。|#0101Adv30_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不久后她便放弃了掩饰，<br>撕下素描本里的其中一页，递给了艾玛。|#0101Adv30_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

