[PrintTextModified Text:（蝴蝶的画！？）|#0101Adv30_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛下意识探出身子，<br>一下子凑近了安安的脸。|#0101Adv30_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这、这个难道是，<br>诺亚画的？|#0101Adv30_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么诺亚会画蝴蝶的画！？<br>又是为什么会<br>画在安安的素描本上！？|#0101Adv30_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安的表情变得十分不悦，<br>她缓缓开口说道。|#0101Adv30_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:吾辈现在很不舒服。<br>大声对吾辈讲话会害吾辈更不舒服。<br>所以——【出去】。|#0101Adv30_AnAn003| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在轻声的话语说出口的瞬间。|#0101Adv30_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Ema Loop:false ScenePositionX:60|70|80 Duration:0.5|0.5|0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的身体违背她本人的意愿<br>开始往后退，离安安越来越远。|#0101Adv30_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:咦，啊，为什么……！？|#0101Adv30_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安在素描本上唰唰写了字，<br>然后举了起来。|#0101Adv30_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_03,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:"『吾辈的魔法是，只要得到对方的认可，<br>　就可以令对方服从指令』|#0101Adv30_AnAn004|" AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『换言之，就是轻度的【洗脑】』|#0101Adv30_AnAn005| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:AnAn Category:Profile Version:2

[PrintTextModified Text:欸——……|#0101Adv30_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这就是安安<br>　不说话的原因……）|#0101Adv30_Ema021|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:两人的距离越来越远。|#0101Adv30_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛心想，<br>安安的内心或许是在拒绝着艾玛……也就是拒绝着他人。|#0101Adv30_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛重重地叹了一口气，<br>最终被赶出了医务室。|#0101Adv30_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

